This project is independently implemented using public specifications and
publicly licensed dependencies. No proprietary source code, internal deployment
configuration or private documentation is included or required.

Third-party dependencies retain their respective licenses. Cargo.lock records
exact dependency versions. The main cryptographic primitives are supplied by the
RustCrypto ecosystem; protocol references and interoperability fixtures are in
docs/cryptography.md. The local Dex example uses a separately distributed Dex
image under its own license. Synthetic RFC6238 test values and public local demo
credentials are not production secrets.
